<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-11-20T13:19:56.389Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 13:19:56 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Philippines is expanding maritime security ties, with France discussing stronger cooperation during a defense attaché visit to Davao and Australia signing a new defence cooperation arrangement, while India deepened bilateral maritime, trade and energy security cooperation. Chinese warships and coast guard vessels operated in four West Philippine Sea areas, prompting legislator Tarriela to condemn the incursions and defend the 2016 arbitral ruling. President Ferdinand Marcos Jr. hosted U.S. President Donald Trump for a state visit that included defence and economic talks alongside the ASEAN summit. The UCDP recorded 176 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Mindanao Sentinel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMie0FVX3lxTE85ZjdTQmJnNGtMVlhCSHhDZGt2Z1RSdWlQaXVMZFJYdTJnS1VKLWpwSC1MYzZESTAyVzRJYk9RSHZMd05vOGtVNTF6XzFibFpTMW5RTnpTZWNaTDVibXFHTmRTMXllbjY0ZzRiYnlSTHJBYmxXaFlqNFltOA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxOWFhWMWw3LXpjR2FVNHNVZW9VRW1GZ1hYRmkzcWRfXzQwbFhfX3hSRXA4UGlWT2NzYklpYjEtRTNPcjVhYlZEOERlZVZuTWdiQ0IzVVFDVTRZbi1xb1N1UC1OME55X1h5cEs3RjNBQ0l3SU42U083aUx4UHZkNGdWaHVTc19sLXFfcTdIeUtWUjgzcU5iN3VOeUlnTF80eUNWRUhkVTB0Tno1U0pUclZCRk1B?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eurasia Review&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxNeFlRb3RwMVQ5MjFSS1VvbjlDX0Z2WHdobzBMOERGTXVnRFNNbzdsdWVzNXFSR1k4Y1d4cnEwMTZiSFItWFR0SmZCTnEwcVNWazNPSDg5ZWUzQUNBQUhiZ3VFUHVscXhUUjROYlV3MFRKVnF3WFYwMXp6d3l6b2xQZXB1aDI3RUVhTFRUaTRCTFQyd2tncmFWLW5odTRleTNmb25XWk55Q012ZkE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Gulf News&lt;/a